class_name DataDungeonsX
## bh-013: fifteen more dungeons across Salmonan, from a level-2 smugglers' cellar under Westreach to the level-58 Maw
## Beneath. Same shape as DataDungeons (which merges this list): themes, surface gates, level ranges per floor, enemy
## pools, the champion of the last sealed floor, the boss, and the Usurper who claims the sanctum once the boss is
## gone. Floor plans are generated offline (DataDungeonPlans, tools/dungeon_gen/gen_plans.py): 2–5 floors each.
## Names are invented for Jre (no borrowed real-culture names — user rule).

## Difficulty tier 1–5 (the old five dungeons are tiers 2–4, see DataDungeons.TIER).
